    <h1>Capital Gains Tax on Property Australia: What You Actually Pay</h1>

    <div class="article-dateline">
      <span class="article-dateline__item">
        <span class="article-dateline__label">Published:</span> {{ datePublished | dateDisplay }}
      </span>
      <span class="article-dateline__sep">·</span>
